{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09027","headline":"紫阁东林居士叔缄赐松英丸捧对忻喜盖非尘侣之所当服輙献诗代啓 · 韦应物","name":"紫阁东林居士叔缄赐松英丸捧对忻喜盖非尘侣之所当服輙献诗代啓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧涧苍松五粒稀，侵云采去露沾衣。\n夜啓羣僊合灵药，朝思俗侣寄将归。\n道场斋戒今初服，人事荤羶已觉非。\n一望岚峰拜还使，腰间铜印与心违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09027.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09027","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}